+--!strict
+-- The reedmail helm (the Reedmail set's helm): a close grey bog-iron bowl over
+-- the brow with a low comb along its crown, its rim laced with reed cord and
+-- knocked with a pale scraped edge. A single reed spike rises from a bone
+-- socket and is capped in bone; a green veil falls at the nape and down either
+-- side of the face. Nothing wide at the ear; all its height above and behind.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+-- The fen's own palette: bog iron, fen green, reed straw, bone and black water.
